                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7037c59a-b1cf-3349-b102-b3574f95d6f3",
                                        "entry_id": "ad5ed156-0db0-323f-894a-04fe81e68a2e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A strong refuge; a defence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca98ff71-8e8b-4e0e-bb71-8521b439ab18",
                                                "sense_id": "7037c59a-b1cf-3349-b102-b3574f95d6f3",
                                                "text": "Thou hast been a shelter for me, and a strong tower from the enemy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "53575690-2af4-3972-8f8d-d1b4c974d3fd",
                                        "entry_id": "ad5ed156-0db0-323f-894a-04fe81e68a2e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A tall fashionable headdress worn in the time of King William III and Queen Anne."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fca5f512-f473-48fc-bbbd-424625d0aa95",
                                                "sense_id": "53575690-2af4-3972-8f8d-d1b4c974d3fd",
                                                "text": "Lay trains of amorous intrigues / In towers, and curls, and periwigs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f0bd50f-d84f-3983-8108-e42a243dcea2",
                                        "entry_id": "ad5ed156-0db0-323f-894a-04fe81e68a2e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "High flight; elevation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8e8d52b-cafe-4dce-9d48-78a6258a561f",
                                                "sense_id": "8f0bd50f-d84f-3983-8108-e42a243dcea2",
                                                "text": "Nigh in her sight\nThe Bird of Jove, stoopt from his aerie tour,\nTwo Birds of gayest plume before him drove."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a37d951d-89dc-3da0-93f0-c75f0d23f9b6",
                                        "entry_id": "ad5ed156-0db0-323f-894a-04fe81e68a2e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The sixteenth trump or Major Arcana card in many Tarot decks, usually deemed an ill omen."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c71488c-393e-334c-b89b-63dad80a9143",
                                        "entry_id": "ad5ed156-0db0-323f-894a-04fe81e68a2e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The nineteenth Lenormand card, representing structure, bureaucracy, stability and loneliness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c971698b-14c4-3295-a6c7-7df25d15567f",
                                        "entry_id": "ad5ed156-0db0-323f-894a-04fe81e68a2e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A group of giraffes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "collective"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40021f04-d6d5-4353-9af7-c31687aa6f21",
                                                "sense_id": "c971698b-14c4-3295-a6c7-7df25d15567f",
                                                "text": "A group of giraffes is called a tower."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f93a2a3-82e7-3ad0-b4f6-c21b484b22fe",
                                        "entry_id": "ad5ed156-0db0-323f-894a-04fe81e68a2e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Each of a set of information technology concerns within a business, which are treated separately so that they can be handled by different providers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd4790ae-4bf4-41ea-a1f1-668a9c943671",
                                                "sense_id": "4f93a2a3-82e7-3ad0-b4f6-c21b484b22fe",
                                                "text": "Suppliers compete separately for the towers and service integrator and management contract, which assists the government in the integration and operation of its services."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b3176c6-e535-4e6d-a982-e9f41af3ae75",
                                                "sense_id": "4f93a2a3-82e7-3ad0-b4f6-c21b484b22fe",
                                                "text": "Service towers are significant IT functional areas, such as infrastructure, applications, security, etc., each possibly managed by a different service provider. The service integrator role is crucial for coordinating and integrating these service towers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fe61ed1c-b7f9-3677-9e66-99d7ce78952d",
                                        "entry_id": "ad5ed156-0db0-323f-894a-04fe81e68a2e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A metal stand used as a pivot to support a punty at a furnace."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "tower",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b40c8b00-d019-3fcb-aea5-fbc03a0c1bd7",
                                        "entry_id": "5113bd89-1050-3a75-8531-e140f7d3ba50",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To be very tall."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ae7598f-a092-44ec-904e-5f074265d8dc",
                                                "sense_id": "b40c8b00-d019-3fcb-aea5-fbc03a0c1bd7",
                                                "text": "The office block towered into the sky."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d4ab179-51b8-4139-80ae-46cdde1b0329",
                                                "sense_id": "b40c8b00-d019-3fcb-aea5-fbc03a0c1bd7",
                                                "text": "Potentilla and Ivory Daphne sat humpily about on the unfolded lawns, and ahead, there towered out enormous cliffs and fantastic pinnacles of what looked like Dolomite."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e2e1dc4-7583-47a6-97f8-29e035fb31c7",
                                                "sense_id": "b40c8b00-d019-3fcb-aea5-fbc03a0c1bd7",
                                                "text": "This is itself a cheerless spot, particularly on a rainy day, when, overshadowed by the great massif of rock that towers in the background, and surrounded by the grey and cheerless quarries, it has a depressing character much in contrast with the green verdure encountered on the northern end of this interesting branch line."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef9df9a4-a670-4630-9f50-4d968dbed149",
                                                "sense_id": "b40c8b00-d019-3fcb-aea5-fbc03a0c1bd7",
                                                "text": "Think of banking today and the image is of grey-suited men in towering skyscrapers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d993921-a20a-3d02-8c26-1da00621382c",
                                        "entry_id": "5113bd89-1050-3a75-8531-e140f7d3ba50",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To be high or lofty; to soar."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7c75f45-5b8b-4350-90bd-eeffd6ac551a",
                                                "sense_id": "1d993921-a20a-3d02-8c26-1da00621382c",
                                                "text": "My lord protector's hawks do tower so well."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bddddd24-30fc-49c6-a456-4126026588f0",
                                                "sense_id": "1d993921-a20a-3d02-8c26-1da00621382c",
                                                "text": "When Hope, the eagle that tower’d, could see\nNo cliff beyond him in the sky,\nHis pinions were bent droopingly —\nAnd homeward turn’d his soften’d eye."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2be2400c-8204-4eac-ae0e-755cdb2911cf",
                                                "sense_id": "1d993921-a20a-3d02-8c26-1da00621382c",
                                                "text": "As we breasted the first summit, the precipitous mass of the Raven's Rock, towering some 250 ft. above the railway, looked grim and forbidding in the failing light, and distant Ben Wyves was shrouded in mist."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ff37f84-c72f-4a0c-b0e5-c0b22926ca8f",
                                                "sense_id": "1d993921-a20a-3d02-8c26-1da00621382c",
                                                "text": "To the left towers the Jungfrau, with the train heading directly towards it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a67eaabd-b78d-3fc7-b9b5-9e41d5c51178",
                                        "entry_id": "5113bd89-1050-3a75-8531-e140f7d3ba50",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To soar into."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b4f6a97-64d9-4c17-bebf-cdac5aa4790d",
                                                "sense_id": "a67eaabd-b78d-3fc7-b9b5-9e41d5c51178",
                                                "text": "Her state with oary feet; yet oft they quit\nThe dank, and, rising on stiff pennons, tower\nThe mid aerial sky"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
